# Optional desktop profile — experimental (Phase 7).
# Install with: build-rootfs.sh --desktop
#
# These are NOT part of the boot contract; they only provide a GUI session you
# start manually from the terminal (or via a future podroid-x11 session hook):
#
#   apk-equivalent:  apt install xfce4 xfce4-terminal
#   in the VM shell:  startxfce4   (connects to the running Xvnc :0)
#
# Keep it light: the VM defaults to 4 GB RAM under TCG emulation (5-20x slower
# than KVM per upstream docs). Cinnamon/LXQt are alternatives; Mint itself is
# not available (no ARM images).
xfce4
xfce4-terminal
x11-utils
